{{/* switch: the compact on/off control shared by table toggle cells, settings
     rows, the form row and the conditional's gate. It is a checkbox, never a
     toggle: nothing in this app flips live — every state here is staged for the
     commit — and a toggle's knob would promise that it had. CSS-only (peer): the
     checkbox drives the box's fill and its check. Callers pass any value with
     On (bool) and Name (form name, optional).

     The control is a bare span, so a caller can wrap it in whatever label the row
     around it calls for without nesting one label inside another. Where it has a
     form name it carries that as its id too, so a label elsewhere in the row —
     the conditional's, at the form's own measure — points at it. A switch no
     label points at (a table or settings row's) carries the row's name as its
     aria-label instead, so it is announced as the thing it switches. */}}
{{/* An 18px white box with a contrasting outline. Checked, it uses the shared
     choice colour with a white check; keyboard focus has a separate outline. */}}
{{define "switch.control"}}<span class="relative inline-flex size-4.5 shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center">
  <input type="checkbox" data-verso-switch{{if .Name}} id="{{.Name}}"{{if not .Disabled}} name="{{.Name}}"{{end}}{{end}}{{with .Label}} aria-label="{{.}}"{{end}}{{with .Described}} aria-describedby="{{.}}"{{end}} class="peer sr-only" value="1"{{if .On}} checked{{end}}{{if .Disabled}} disabled{{end}}>
  {{/* A fixed state (disabled) keeps its shape and its check in the inert
       sand, so it reads as stated rather than as a choice not yet made. */}}
  <span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-xs border border-choice-border bg-white shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(27,25,23,.06)] transition-colors peer-checked:border-choice peer-checked:bg-choice peer-focus-visible:outline-2 peer-focus-visible:outline-offset-2 peer-focus-visible:outline-denim-deep peer-disabled:border-inert peer-disabled:shadow-none peer-disabled:peer-checked:bg-inert"></span>
  <span class="relative text-white opacity-0 peer-checked:opacity-100">{{icon "check" "size-3.5 [stroke-width:3]"}}</span>
</span>{{end}}
<label class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center">{{template "switch.control" .}}</label>
